        "id": 205810,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-05T01:47:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I imagine it's probably a little like a similar routine I go through when dealing with my mom's various healthcare and social workers.</p><p>\"Oh, you're giving me a hard time about doing something it's supposed to be your job to do for us. Hang on a sec. Oh hey mom, this person on the phone wants to tell you how you just don't deserve to have them do their job for you, I'm sure you'll be just thrilled...\"</p><p>*five minutes of loud disabled elderly woman yelling into the phone later*</p><p>\"What's that? You're very sorry and will be totally happy to do what you were supposed to do the first time I asked? Aw you're too kind.\"</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:35:11.630Z",
