      {
        "id": 205813,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-05T15:48:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The Good Cop, Bad Cop routine is needed for shippping.&nbsp; You want drivers and shippers to enjoy dealing with you, but you also at times need them to be afraid that Bad Cop is going to make their boss angry at them, so they don't take you for granted.</p><p>Every single higher volume dock that I've worked on has needed someone to be the bad cop.</p><p>Also I was so excited to see the Business Blog get a post, hope it can get more attention in the future, you know, when suddenly there is more time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"Is way pro at forklifts.\"</p><p>This is code for watch out if you enter the warehouse, because forklift will be moving fast, and you will slow down everything by making Jodie account for your easily crushed mortal form.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:35:11.830Z",
